sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant AG as Agent (LangGraph)
    participant LLM as OpenAI
    participant MCP as MCP server
    participant API as Blog API
    participant DB as Posts (DynamoDB)

    User->>AG: "Write a short post about MCP and publish it"
    AG->>LLM: messages + tools
    LLM-->>AG: tool_call create_post {title, content, author}
    AG->>MCP: tools/call create_post
    MCP->>API: POST /posts
    API->>DB: counter + PutItem
    API-->>MCP: 201 {id: 8, status: draft}
    MCP-->>AG: result {id: 8, ...}

    AG->>LLM: messages + result
    LLM-->>AG: tool_call publish_post {post_id: 8}
    AG->>MCP: tools/call publish_post
    MCP->>API: POST /posts/8/publish
    API->>DB: UpdateItem status=published
    API-->>MCP: 200 {id: 8, status: published}
    MCP-->>AG: result

    AG->>LLM: messages + result
    LLM-->>AG: streamed answer "Published post 8 ..."
    AG-->>User: tokens over SSE
